    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mgo6duz",
      "content": "Madhya Pradesh has witnessed significant economic growth in the past two decades. The state is predominantly agrarian, with agriculture contributing significantly to the state's economy. However, the industrial and services sectors have been growing rapidly. The state has been recognized for its good governance and investment-friendly policies, often receiving awards for fiscal discipline and governance."
    },
