      "content": "4.2 Agriculture"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0bymnlc",
      "content": "Agriculture is the backbone of Madhya Pradesh's economy. The state has diverse agro-climatic zones that support a wide variety of crops. Madhya Pradesh is the leading producer of soybean, chickpea (chana), mustard, coriander, and several other crops in India."
